title Vinyl Knock-knock and multitasking: the screen off (all black), then hidden (Super, Alt+Tab): the light comes back with the launcher; shown again, the first tap acts (the output button opens its page) and the page is repainted
sizes 640x480
ppmm 901
lifecycle
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_SCREEN 1
env VINYL_DEMO_KNOCK 1

wait 800
tapxy 0.223 0.373
tapxy 0.223 0.373
tapxy 0.223 0.373
wait 300
tap "Evolve 65"
wait 300
expect notext "Automatic"
shot 00-off-black
hide
expect hidden
wait 600
show
expect visible
wait 400
expect repaint
shot 01-shown-again
tap "Evolve 65"
wait 300
expect text "Automatic"
shot 02-first-tap-acts
close
expect quit
